**Nicholas — UI/UX Designer**

Nicholas  is a passionate Information Technology student at the University of Ghana with a strong interest in UI/UX design and digital product development. As a UI/UX Designer, he focuses on creating intuitive, accessible, and visually engaging user experiences that solve real-world problems. Nicholas combines creativity with user-centered design principles to develop wireframes, prototypes, user flows, and responsive interfaces using modern design tools such as Figma. He enjoys collaborating with developers, project managers, and other team members to transform ideas into functional digital products. Nicholas is continuously improving his design and technical skills while building practical experience through academic and software engineering projects.
